docs {
  # Loans

  Lending one **physical copy** to a borrower. Each lending event is its own loan; a copy can
  have only one active loan at a time (enforced by a unique database index), and returning the
  copy frees it for a new loan while the old one stays as history. Availability is derived from
  the active loan, never stored on the copy. There is no loan deletion.

  Run the folder in order. **Register loans reader** creates its own disposable account and the
  folder creates its own book and copies, so it is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Loans").
}
